  "description": {
    "text": "Team Plasma Powered Deck 30, a half deck released on 14 September 2012 with the Plasma Gale expansion, which brought cards themed on Team Plasma of Pokémon Black 2 and White 2. It gathers Plasma Gale's Team Plasma cards, Pokémon, Trainers and Energy that work together, into one ready-built deck, with a Team Plasma power-up guide and a quick guide.",
